WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.490
Unit nineteen. Simple Complaints!

2
00:00:04.466 --> 00:00:11.868
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Elementary level!

3
00:00:11.918 --> 00:00:15.247
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:19.155
Today we learn: Simple Complaints. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:24.497
Complaint. Say it with me. Complaint!

6
00:00:28.053 --> 00:00:31.570
Problem. Say it with me. Problem!

7
00:00:35.008 --> 00:00:38.959
Refund. Say it with me. Refund!

8
00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:47.058
Apologize. Say it with me. Apologize!

9
00:00:50.555 --> 00:00:54.155
Broken. Say it with me. Broken!

10
00:00:57.654 --> 00:01:01.538
Return. Say it with me. Return!

11
00:01:05.018 --> 00:01:09.635
Unsatisfied. Say it with me. Unsatisfied!

12
00:01:13.225 --> 00:01:17.242
Resolve. Say it with me. Resolve!

13
00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:29.463
Grammar time! Polite requests with 'could'. Listen. Could I get a refund, please?

14
00:01:29.513 --> 00:01:34.353
Your turn. Say it with me. Could I get a refund, please?

15
00:01:39.493 --> 00:01:51.732
When there is a problem with a product, I make a polite complaint. If it's broken, I ask to return it or get a refund. The shop usually apologizes and tries to resolve the issue.

16
00:01:51.782 --> 00:01:53.265
I like this story!

17
00:01:54.288 --> 00:01:59.730
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:00.930
Refund!

19
00:02:01.914 --> 00:02:07.296
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:07.346 --> 00:02:08.731
Unsatisfied!

21
00:02:09.997 --> 00:02:18.831
Think and answer. How would you politely complain about a broken product?

22
00:02:18.881 --> 00:02:20.031
Great answer!

23
00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:24.090
This unit's value is Assertiveness.

24
00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.015
I can show assertiveness every day!

25
00:02:27.899 --> 00:02:36.925
Congratulations, everyone! You finished the Elementary level. See you in Pre-Intermediate. Goodbye!

26
00:02:36.975 --> 00:02:41.400
Thank you, Teacher Chanthy! See you in Pre-Intermediate!

